[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/comments/2465406513","html_url":"https://github.com/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/2613#issuecomment-2465406513","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/2613","id":2465406513,"node_id":"IC_kwDOA0JFE86S8x4x","user":{"login":"xsuchy","id":85769,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg1NzY5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/85769?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/xsuchy","html_url":"https://github.com/xsuchy","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xsuchy/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xsuchy/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xsuchy/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xsuchy/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xsuchy/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xsuchy/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xsuchy/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xsuchy/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xsuchy/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2024-11-08T17:38:31Z","updated_at":"2024-11-08T17:38:31Z","body":"Text of the license:\r\n\r\n```\r\nAdditional IP Rights Grant (Patents)\r\n------------------------------------\r\n\r\n\"These implementations\" means the copyrightable works that implement the WebM\r\ncodecs distributed by Google as part of the WebM Project.\r\n\r\nGoogle hereby grants to you a perpetual, worldwide, non-exclusive, no-charge,\r\nroyalty-free, irrevocable (except as stated in this section) patent license to\r\nmake, have made, use, offer to sell, sell, import, transfer, and otherwise\r\nrun, modify and propagate the contents of these implementations of WebM, where\r\nsuch license applies only to those patent claims, both currently owned by\r\nGoogle and acquired in the future, licensable by Google that are necessarily\r\ninfringed by these implementations of WebM. This grant does not include claims\r\nthat would be infringed only as a consequence of further modification of these\r\nimplementations. If you or your agent or exclusive licensee institute or order\r\nor agree to the institution of patent litigation or any other patent\r\nenforcement activity against any entity (including a cross-claim or\r\ncounterclaim in a lawsuit) alleging that any of these implementations of WebM\r\nor any code incorporated within any of these implementations of WebM\r\nconstitute direct or contributory patent infringement, or inducement of\r\npatent infringement, then any patent rights granted to you under this License\r\nfor these implementations of WebM shall terminate as of the date such\r\nlitigation is filed.\r\n```\r\n\r\nThis is similar - both textual and semantics - to https://gitlab.com/fedora/legal/fedora-license-data/-/issues/583 and it may be a case to AdditionRef-*","author_association":"COLLABORATOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/comments/2465406513/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/comments/2465669654","html_url":"https://github.com/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/2613#issuecomment-2465669654","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/2613","id":2465669654,"node_id":"IC_kwDOA0JFE86S9yIW","user":{"login":"richardfontana","id":1179636,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjExNzk2MzY=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1179636?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/richardfontana","html_url":"https://github.com/richardfontana","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/richardfontana/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/richardfontana/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/richardfontana/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/richardfontana/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/richardfontana/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/richardfontana/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/richardfontana/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/richardfontana/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/richardfontana/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2024-11-08T20:09:49Z","updated_at":"2024-11-08T20:11:06Z","body":"At least as I understand it, `AdditionRef-` would never be used by SPDX in its license identifier/exception lists. There is a question here though whether this could qualify for inclusion in the SPDX exception list, which includes whether it's the sort of thing that SPDX would or should consider a type of 'exception' or grant of additional permission.\r\n\r\nAnother point is that substantially the same language has been used in a number of other Google-maintained projects. ","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/comments/2465669654/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/comments/2465855907","html_url":"https://github.com/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/2613#issuecomment-2465855907","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/2613","id":2465855907,"node_id":"IC_kwDOA0JFE86S-fmj","user":{"login":"goneall","id":378172,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM3ODE3Mg==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/378172?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/goneall","html_url":"https://github.c